        "Description": "Greetings, 47. The ICA has tracked down the last supporters of Jin Po&apos;s militia, and we are about to take down one of the biggest radicalist parties in the world. You are tasked with eliminating Joseph Byrne and Juliano Carrizo.\r\rByrne is a trafficking organizer working for Jin Po, having ordered the execution of hundreds of innocent people, and Carrizo is working for Byrne as a bodyguard, having also executed families. Eliminate them now and Jin Po&apos;s legacy is erased.",
